  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I believe we should have a OCE region.\n\nThis has been asked before plenty times before but it REALLY needs and deserves some attention.\n\nRight now, Aussie and Kiwi players are stuck choosing between US servers, EU and Japan, which means we are essentially hard locked to 200-250+ ping no matter what we do. We have a massive, dedicated player base down here.. MASSIVE, but the constant high latency makes the experience feel clunky compared to the rest of the world.\n\nHaving our own regional servers would be a massive quality of life upgrade and make the whole platform feel so much smoother for thousands of us.\n\nWe would absolutely love to see this happen! C:",
